  "description": "This receipt is a thermal fiscal point-of-sale (POS) receipt issued by JYSK Poland from Store P337, located at ul. Metalowców 5, 26-110 Skarżysko-Kamienna, Poland. The header contains the JYSK logo, company name, store number, address, BDO registration number, tax identification number (NIP), receipt print number, and transaction date. The fiscal section includes the receipt title (PARAGON FISKALNY), followed by a tax summary showing Taxable Sales (Sprzed. opod. PTU A), 23% VAT, VAT Amount (Podatek PTU), and the Grand Total (SUMA PLN). The payment section records a terminal card payment, transaction reference, and total amount paid. The footer promotes the official JYSK.pl website for offers and concludes with a barcode. This is a standard Polish retail fiscal receipt used by JYSK home furnishing stores.",
